                "question": "2001 年 3 月的门店营业额是多少？口径：门店营业额 = 门店销售行的净支付额（store_sales.ss_net_paid）之和，按销售日期归属期间。保留两位小数。",
                "sql": "SELECT ROUND(SUM(ss.ss_net_paid), 2) AS store_revenue\nFROM store_sales ss\nJOIN date_dim d ON ss.ss_sold_date_sk = d.d_date_sk\nWHERE d.d_year = 2001 AND d.d_moy = 3"
